    kind: work_item  # 0835
    title: "scala: a def with no declared return type (lila 52% of defs, sbt 14%) feeds nothing to WI-gokop's return-type registry, so chains through it stay untyped"  # 0835
    status: todo_hard  # 0835
    priority: 3  # 0835
