  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/iobcat2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Re-checked 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e (WI-gokop merged, d928c4624a). _extract_scala_return_type_name still returns None when return_type is absent. Fixture: def declared(): FileWriter vs def undeclared() = new FileWriter(..): a.write -> scala:java.io.FileWriter:0-0:write, b.write -> scala:external:0-0:write with no receiver_type_hint. Premise holds; corpus share figures not re-measured. MECHANISM: return-type registry is fed only by a def's declared return_type field; an undeclared def's body expression is never typed. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-koraz."  # e44f
